    "properties": {
        "name": {
            "description": "Name of the product",
            "type": "string"
        },
        "price": {
            "type": "number",
            "exclusiveMinimum": 0
        }
    },
    "required": ["id", "name", "price"]
}
```


### 例 - JSON スキーマを用いてエンティティを検証する

